# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in the working tree alike.
#
# Without eol=lf a Windows checkout hands every editor CRLF, and anything that
# rewrites a file whole — the version sync script, a formatter, a codemod —
# commits it back as a full-file diff containing nothing but carriage returns.
# Pinning both directions keeps diffs to the lines that actually changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.woff2 binary
